 "kit": "A Thorn Militia levy spearman: a bark-brown leather jerkin, worn under a sleeveless surcoat of deep bottle-green cloth that covers his whole chest and belly from the collar down to just below the knees, front and back, split at the front below the belt so the legs can stride and held at the waist by a knotted rope belt; a short deep bottle-green hooded cloak with the hood up, covering the shoulders and the upper back; padded sleeves and leather bracers; wrapped legs and soft boots; bark-brown weathered skin; a long dark hawthorn spear with a barbed head of bone and iron shaped like a great thorn. No shield, no antlers. Plain and poor.",
